  "details": "Based of the game \"Tower Unite\". Create and decorate your own condo with approved objects modeled by the steam community and the VRC team. Implement a currency system and develop games for everyone to play in various worlds to gain coins in-order to afford the cost of new furniture bought from a store inside a new main world center. Invite your friends or open the condo up for the public to join. Explore by joining other people's condos and meet new friends and experience various of individual designs and ideas in decorations. Perhaps various house types at different prices could make a user 'stand out' for their expensive decor and type of house they own. A server list for condos should be available to allow visitors to find your house and knock on your door.",
